{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03380",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 5.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I mean, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.49,
      "end_seconds": 10.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.38,
      "end_seconds": 18.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "It's a severe headache for days. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.64,
      "end_seconds": 23.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.43,
      "end_seconds": 40.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.98,
      "text": "It's been about four days, I'm fairly sure. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.41,
      "end_seconds": 47.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.16,
      "end_seconds": 56.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "It sort of comes and goes. Moderate, really. I notice it more with lying down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.06,
      "end_seconds": 59.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Any drowsiness as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.03,
      "end_seconds": 62.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.99,
      "end_seconds": 67.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Right, would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.54,
      "end_seconds": 73.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "A three out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.3,
      "end_seconds": 76.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.24,
      "end_seconds": 86.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.78,
      "end_seconds": 114.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 147 over 91, heart rate 94, temperature 36.7. And respiratory rate 18, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.62,
      "end_seconds": 118.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.99,
      "end_seconds": 121.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.88,
      "end_seconds": 128.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.06,
      "end_seconds": 132.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.35,
      "end_seconds": 149.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "The optic discs look swollen and you are drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.37,
      "end_seconds": 153.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.02,
      "end_seconds": 167.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Any fever, head injury or weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.27,
      "end_seconds": 174.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Ah, no, no fever, head injury or weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.11,
      "end_seconds": 177.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.6,
      "end_seconds": 180.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.57,
      "end_seconds": 186.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.98,
      "end_seconds": 193.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.96,
      "end_seconds": 201.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Right, so arthritis in your knees is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.43,
      "end_seconds": 219.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.96,
      "end_seconds": 223.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.04,
      "end_seconds": 227.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.52,
      "end_seconds": 239.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Well, I had a caesarean for my second baby nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.65,
      "end_seconds": 243.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.22,
      "end_seconds": 256.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Telmisartan. I take it 40 milligrams, once a day for my pressure. Diclofenac, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.78,
      "end_seconds": 264.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.82,
      "end_seconds": 266.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "It's 50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.52,
      "end_seconds": 267.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.09,
      "end_seconds": 281.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.0,
      "end_seconds": 285.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.04,
      "end_seconds": 291.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.44,
      "end_seconds": 295.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.77,
      "end_seconds": 298.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.2,
      "end_seconds": 306.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.56,
      "end_seconds": 334.34,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards possible cerebral venous thrombosis. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.85,
      "end_seconds": 338.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.15,
      "end_seconds": 357.11,
      "duration_seconds": 16.96,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now possible cerebral venous thrombosis is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book an MRI of the head to look into papilloedema. Right, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.47,
      "end_seconds": 362.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}